{"source": {"title": "浣溪沙·一曲新词酒一杯", "author": "晏殊", "text": "一曲新词酒一杯，去年天气旧亭台。夕阳西下几时回？
无可奈何花落去，似曾相识燕归来。小园香径独徘徊。"}, "translation": "A New Tune, a Cup of Wine  
By Yan Shu

I sing a new song with a cup of wine;  
The weather is like last year’s, the old pavilion remains.  
When does the setting sun in the west return?  

Helpless, the flowers fall away;  
Familiar as ever, the swallows come back.  
Alone I linger on the fragrant path within the small garden."}

{"source": {"title": "浣溪沙·一曲新词酒一杯", "author": "晏殊", "text": "一曲新词酒一杯，去年天气旧亭台。夕阳西下几时回？
无可奈何花落去，似曾相识燕归来。小园香径独徘徊。"}, "translation": "A new song, a cup of wine;
The weather and old terrace as they were last year.
When will the setting sun return?
Helpless, the flowers fall away;
Seemingly familiar, the swallows come back.
Alone I linger on the fragrant path in the small garden."}

{"source": {"title": "浣溪沙·一曲新词酒一杯", "author": "晏殊", "text": "一曲新词酒一杯，去年天气旧亭台。夕阳西下几时回？
无可奈何花落去，似曾相识燕归来。小园香径独徘徊。"}, "translation": "A new song, a cup of wine;
The weather is as last year, the pavilion old and unchanged.
When will the setting sun return?

Helpless, the flowers fall away;
