{"source": {"title": "春望", "author": "杜甫", "text": "国破山河在，城春草木深。
感时花溅泪，恨别鸟惊心。
烽火连三月，家书抵万金。
白头搔更短，浑欲不胜簪。"}, "translation": "Spring Gaze

The nation broken, mountains and rivers remain;
City in spring, grass and trees deep.
Feeling the times, flowers splash tears;
Hating parting, birds startle the heart.
Fires of war span three months;
Home letters worth ten thousand gold.
White hair scratched thinner;
Barely able to bear a pin."}

